    "notes": [
      "Boundary polygons for the five Kamrup Metropolitan assembly segments and for the three Darrang district segments (Sipajhar, Mangaldai, Dalgaon) are APPROXIMATE locality-based coverage areas created for this demo.",
      "They are NOT official Delimitation Commission boundaries and must be replaced with verified GIS polygon data before production use.",
      "Segments without polygons are listed without boundaries; the resolver reports 'outside_supported_area' until their boundary data is added.",
      "The Lok Sabha segments reflect the current post-delimitation composition: Guwahati (10 ACs) and Darrang-Udalguri (11 ACs, renamed from Mangaldoi in ECI delimitation 2023) per Wikipedia and ECI final order 2023, retrieved 2026-08-22.",
      "Mangaldai town centre (~26.43, 92.03) falls inside the Mangaldai (AS-050) approximate polygon. Sipajhar and Dalgaon polygons are adjacent in Darrang district."
    ]
  },
